# Continue Command Handler

## Purpose
This prompt snippet instructs the AI CTO on how to handle the "continue" command from users.

## Usage
Include this in AI CTO masterplan generation prompts to handle cases where users want to proceed with suggested defaults.

## Content
- When user types "continue" after questions:
  - Proceed with suggested answers you provided
  - Treat this as an indication that the user accepts all your suggested answers and wants to move forward